    "Normal-map removal alone leaves the shutter nearly black; receiveShadow=false alone also leaves it nearly black. Prior independent aoMap=null diagnosis similarly remained black. These single-variable outcomes do not prove absence of interactions.",
    "MeshBasic using the same source map, original white color/side/clipping/opacity with unchanged scene post-processing reveals clear shutter texture. This narrows the issue to the lit PBR shading path in combination with the dark source map/current grading; it does not identify a single faulty formula or justify shipping Basic.",
    "CPU material color and actual after-draw GPU diffuse are both white. Hemisphere and directional GPU uniforms are populated with expected nonzero colors; no missing-light or zero-color uniform was observed.",
    "Both runtime camera candidates visually include their intended props: service crate/carton and laundry crate/pot/sign. These are candidate compositions, not changes to source presets."
